WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.940
About 1.8 million people face emergency hunger in Yemen as strikes widen. This is Omni View, episode 250. From there, Spain's election, Baghdad's border push, floods on the Pacific Coast, a vaccine trial, Indian workers in Germany, and a blast beside a school in Afghanistan. Yemen's recognized government has opened a wide round of airstrikes on Houthi-held ground. Al-Jazeera reported that military spokesman Colonel Majid Al-Nuzali said

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:37.660
government forces carried out 726 attacks in the 24 hours before Friday and claimed 121 fighters

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:43.860
and commanders were killed or wounded. From Sanaa, Al Jazeera's Yusuf Maury said the Saudi-led

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:49.380
coalition that backs the government hit more than six governorates overnight. A gas station in

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:54.940
the Tahir district injured 13 people, three of them critically. The Houthis said a later strike

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:56.860
killed a man and his wife in their home.

00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:03.140
Maury also described a fuel station in Bonnie, Matar, a raid on Taís and five raids in

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:04.700
Mocha that hit a power station.

00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:11.240
Houthi-affiliated media set a Saudi strike in Al-Turba in Taís, killed 11 civilians, most

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:12.000
of them children.

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:16.540
Al-Jazeera could not confirm that toll, and the coalition did not comment.

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.880
The government run Sabha News Agency said Houthi attacks on government locations in Taís

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:27.260
on Saturday killed three civilians, including a 10-year-old boy, and wounded three others,

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:32.840
including an infant. Coalition officials said a Houthi missile aimed at Riyadh was intercepted.

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:38.300
None of those casualty claims was independently verified. The World Food Program and the

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:43.300
Food and Agriculture Organization, the United Nations agencies for Food Aid and Farming,

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:49.580
warned on Friday that hunger is likely to worsen over the next six months. More than 300,000 people

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:55.000
have been newly displaced since the escalation began, mostly in Taís, Lahidj, and Adam.

00:01:55.660 --> 00:02:00.540
The agencies said the Houthis encircled Taís in early October that their areas are harder

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:04.100
to reach and that they are holding 73 United Nations staff.

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:09.080
Aid groups say cuts by donors, including the United States and other Western countries,

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:12.340
have deepened the crisis as food and fuel prices soar.

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:16.180
The Houthis, backed by Iran, seized Sanaa in 2014.

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:21.160
17 Saudi Arabia led a coalition from March 2015 for the recognized government.

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:27.060
Fighting resumed in July after a 2022 ceasefire collapsed, in the tension around the United

00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:28.780
States Israel war on Iran.

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:37.320
Al-Nuzali said fighting was still going in Marib, Al-Jawf, Taiz, Lahid, Shabwa, Medi, and

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:37.960
Al-Dhaleh.

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:43.340
Both armies are fighting again, and the hunger and displacement numbers come from those two

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:46.620
United Nations agencies, not from either Spokesman.

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:49.700
Al-Nuzaili's account is a military campaign.

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:55.220
Hundreds of attacks in a day against fighters and commanders, answering Houthi fire that includes

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:59.340
a missile toward Riyadh and attack Sabah said killed civilians in Taiz.

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:04.820
The Houthi account is that a Saudi strike killed 11 civilians, most of them children,

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:06.780
so the bombs are hitting families.

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:09.220
Each claim stops at the same wall.

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:16.480
The civilian toll was not confirmed. The coalition was silent, and no outside count has verified either side's dead.

00:03:17.559 --> 00:03:25.319
Spain's voters go to a snap election on Sunday that could put the far-right Vox party in national government for the first time in five decades.

00:03:25.919 --> 00:03:28.539
Half a century after Franco's dictatorship ended.

00:03:29.259 --> 00:03:34.159
Al Jazeera reported that the campaign closed on Friday, turned on housing and immigration.

00:03:34.839 --> 00:03:39.359
Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez, 54, of the Socialist Workers' Party,

00:03:39.579 --> 00:03:44.599
has governed since 2018. Poles give the conservative People's Party the most seats,

00:03:45.119 --> 00:03:52.079
but it needs Vox, projected third, to reach 176 seats in the 350-seat Congress of deputies.

00:03:52.679 --> 00:03:57.639
Most surveys put the two together at that line, which would let People's Party leader Alberto

00:03:57.639 --> 00:04:04.439
Nunez-Fageo form a coalition or a minority government with Vox behind it. Sanchez called the vote in

00:04:04.439 --> 00:04:09.619
October after Parliament rejected two measures meant to protect renters, following protests

00:04:09.619 --> 00:04:11.399
over housing costs and evictions.

00:04:12.079 --> 00:04:18.519
The European Commission forecast growth of 2.6% for Spain this year, against 1.2% for

00:04:18.519 --> 00:04:19.139
the Eurozone.

00:04:19.779 --> 00:04:25.099
France 24 reported that Vox built its campaign on immigration after tens of thousands of

00:04:25.099 --> 00:04:30.019
people crossed in July from Morocco into Ceuta, a Spanish city in North Africa.

00:04:30.019 --> 00:04:34.819
The South China Morning Post noted that Europe is opening a year of elections that could

00:04:34.819 --> 00:04:37.219
shift the balance inside the European Union.

00:04:37.979 --> 00:04:43.179
Alvaro Sanchez Garcia, a political scientist at Spain's Center for Political and Constitutional

00:04:43.179 --> 00:04:49.259
Studies, told Al Jazeera the vote has been cast as a yes or no on Sanchez, and that people

00:04:49.259 --> 00:04:52.759
who switch parties mostly stay inside the same left or right block.

00:04:53.419 --> 00:04:58.299
In 2023 his party finished second and he stayed in office with parties to his left and

00:04:58.299 --> 00:05:00.099
with Catalan and Basque groupings.

00:05:00.599 --> 00:05:05.259
He has clashed with the United States President Donald Trump, refused a request from other

00:05:05.259 --> 00:05:10.959
members of NATO, the North Atlantic Treaty Organization, to lift defense spending to 5%

00:05:10.959 --> 00:05:13.719
and called Israel's war in Gaza a genocide.

00:05:14.459 --> 00:05:19.219
On Friday, he told a radio interviewer he could not conceive of losing and told a Madrid

00:05:19.219 --> 00:05:24.459
rally the election was about one thing only, whether Spain moves forward or goes backwards.

00:05:24.459 --> 00:05:29.919
His case is that the country has never been in better shape, growing faster than a stagnant

00:05:29.919 --> 00:05:34.139
Eurozone, with a progressive record that made him a reference for the European left.

00:05:34.739 --> 00:05:38.139
The limit is the October defeat on renters that forced this vote.

00:05:38.719 --> 00:05:43.939
Fajus' case put to him in a televised debate last week, is that you cannot eat gross domestic

00:05:43.939 --> 00:05:48.439
product, and that alleged corruption and opportunism require a new government.

00:05:48.439 --> 00:05:54.979
Isabel Labayan, 64, a longtime people's party voter, asked how Spain can be praised

00:05:54.979 --> 00:05:59.879
abroad when people cannot afford a house or food, or see a doctor in days rather than

00:05:59.879 --> 00:06:00.239
months.

00:06:00.939 --> 00:06:06.759
Vox's case, as France 24 described the campaign, is that the July arrivals in Siyuta should

00:06:06.759 --> 00:06:07.919
decide who governs.

00:06:08.419 --> 00:06:11.939
Poles are not ballots, and Fajou still needs vox for a majority.

00:06:11.939 --> 00:06:12.099
party.

00:06:12.559 --> 00:06:17.799
Watch whether those two parties together reach 176 seats when Sunday's count is finished.

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:22.730
Iraq's Prime Minister has American backing for a crackdown on oil smuggling.

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:28.550
Al-Jazeera reported that President Donald Trump wrote on Friday, on Truth Social, that

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:33.090
Washington supports Ali al-Zahidi's effort to assert state authority throughout Iraq.

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:39.010
Stop the smuggling of Iraqi oil, end corruption, and bring all weapons under the exclusive control

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:42.970
of the state, and to build an Iraq that makes its own political decisions.

00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:49.350
It was Washington's first comment on the strain between Baghdad and Erbil, seat of the semi-autonomous

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:50.150
Kurdish region.

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:55.530
On Tuesday, al-Zahidi moved to put the region's border crossings in several oil fields under

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:56.350
federal control.

00:06:57.030 --> 00:07:01.910
On Wednesday, Iraq's top court ruled that Baghdad made deploy federal forces along every

00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:04.970
international border, including the Kurdish regions.

00:07:04.970 --> 00:07:09.910
On Thursday, Iraq closed two crossings there, one with Syria and one with Iran.

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:15.350
Talks between Baghdad and Erbil are due on December 1st, sponsored by the head of the

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:16.650
Supreme Judicial Council.

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:23.410
The campaign began in Jerf al-Sakar, also called Jerf al-Nasar, in Babil province south

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:24.230
of Baghdad.

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:29.850
Qatayib Hezbollah, an Iran-backed group the United States designates a terrorist organization,

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:32.150
has held the town since 2014.

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:37.450
After it, an allied group took it from the Islamic State and most Sunni residents were displaced.

00:07:38.110 --> 00:07:43.330
Senior Iraqi security and oil officials told Reuters the group has run a smuggling network there.

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:47.690
Siphoning state crude worth hundreds of millions of dollars since 2021.

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:52.390
Nine senior security and oil officials have been dismissed and sent to the courts.

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:55.210
Katayib Hezbollah denies the allegations.

00:07:55.970 --> 00:07:58.850
Al Zayedi gave the group until November 20 to leave.

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:04.910
A day before that deadline, after reported intervention by Esmeral Khani, head of Iran's

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:09.090
Kudz force, government forces entered and set up a joint operations center.

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:15.490
Katayev Hezbollah units are due to withdraw gradually as Army, Federal Police, Energy Police

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:18.970
and Popular Mobilization Forces units move in by stages.

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:24.470
Harakat al-Nujaba and Katayev Sayed al-Shuhada have also refused to disarm.

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:29.610
Armed groups missed a September 30th deadline to hand over weapons, and the government

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:35.610
pushed that deadline to June 2027. Government spokesperson Hyder Alibudi told the Iraqi

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:43.350
news agency that Iraq lost an estimated $100 billion between 2008 and 2025 from oil smuggled

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:49.470
through the Kurdish region. Salim Zakur, a constitutional law researcher, told Al Jazeera

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:54.930
the American Post tells Kurdish leaders that Baghdad's measures have strong American backing.

00:08:55.807 --> 00:09:01.647
Pure in northern Peru is under waste high water after 12 hours of rain that began on Thursday.

00:09:02.227 --> 00:09:07.627
Part of downpours Al Jazeera linked to an exceptionally strong El Nino, a warming of the sea

00:09:07.627 --> 00:09:12.607
surface in the central and eastern equatorial Pacific that shifts wind and rain worldwide.

00:09:12.607 --> 00:09:19.407
Louise Vasquez, chief of the National Institute of Civil Defense, told RPP radio that preliminary

00:09:19.407 --> 00:09:23.027
reports put affected families in Pura at about 2000.

00:09:23.947 --> 00:09:28.507
The Jose Cayetano Heredia Hospital moved patients from its Respiratory Infection Ward

00:09:28.507 --> 00:09:32.207
to the Auditorium, and more serious patients to intensive care.

00:09:32.827 --> 00:09:36.287
The main square and many businesses in public buildings flooded too.

00:09:36.947 --> 00:09:39.387
Peru's armed forces have sent people and pumps.

00:09:39.387 --> 00:09:43.147
Some residents said machines stopped because the fuel ran out.

00:09:43.647 --> 00:09:47.587
The weather service warned that moderate to heavy rain could continue in parts of the

00:09:47.587 --> 00:09:48.667
region for four days.

00:09:49.347 --> 00:09:54.047
President Keiko Fujimori postponed a trip to Columbia and said she plans to go to the

00:09:54.047 --> 00:09:54.847
affected areas.

00:09:55.427 --> 00:10:00.747
The Navy blamed El Nino for ocean swalls that damaged Pacific coast infrastructure and

00:10:00.747 --> 00:10:02.607
temporarily closed dozens of ports.

00:10:03.307 --> 00:10:08.727
In Ecuador, the National Secretariat for Risk Management said on Friday that 34 people

00:10:08.727 --> 00:10:11.307
had died and 47,000 had been affected.

00:10:11.947 --> 00:10:14.087
In Manta, two rivers broke their banks.

00:10:14.707 --> 00:10:19.367
Resident Fernanda Navarrete said she had been soaking in mud for four days and had lost

00:10:19.367 --> 00:10:21.287
furniture, clothes, and appliances.

00:10:22.147 --> 00:10:26.967
Peru and Ecuador are among several Latin American countries that have declared national emergencies,

00:10:27.487 --> 00:10:30.827
and this year's El Nino is projected to be the strongest on record.

00:10:31.527 --> 00:10:36.447
Pierre Garavito, whose refrigerator was floating in his Santa Margarita home, said this was

00:10:36.447 --> 00:10:39.267
only the first heavy rain and that he had lost everything.

00:10:39.987 --> 00:10:44.567
The South China Morning Post carried the same pure a toll and the same picture of waste

00:10:44.567 --> 00:10:45.227
high water.

00:10:46.334 --> 00:10:51.374
Uganda has opened Africa's first clinical trial of a messenger RNA vaccine against the

00:10:51.374 --> 00:10:53.014
Bundy Bugio strain of Ebola.

00:10:53.654 --> 00:10:56.994
The strain behind the outbreak in the Democratic Republic of the Congo.

00:10:57.834 --> 00:11:02.634
Al Jazeera reported that the state run Uganda Virus Research Institute set on Friday the

00:11:02.634 --> 00:11:06.414
trial is with Moderna, the United States company that makes the shot.

00:11:06.974 --> 00:11:08.154
It is the second trial.

00:11:08.434 --> 00:11:12.574
The first began in Canada in August and enrolled adults from 18 to 65.

00:11:13.274 --> 00:11:17.594
This one is the first to test safety and immune response in children aged one and above,

00:11:18.194 --> 00:11:20.954
and it aims to enroll 224 volunteers.

00:11:21.634 --> 00:11:26.254
Richard Hatchett, chief executive of the Coalition for Epidemic Preparedness Innovations,

00:11:26.634 --> 00:11:31.314
which is helping fund the vaccine, said children are often hit hardest when Ebola strikes,

00:11:31.314 --> 00:11:33.814
and are too often last to receive new vaccines.

00:11:34.414 --> 00:11:39.854
A second candidate, Chattanox I, from India's Serum Institute and the University of Oxford,

00:11:40.374 --> 00:11:42.734
is due to start testing in the Congo on Monday.

00:11:43.454 --> 00:11:48.494
Gavi, the alliance that helps lower income countries buy vaccines, signed a purchase commitment

00:11:48.494 --> 00:11:53.814
last week for 1.5 million doses, and plans to have hundreds of thousands ready if the

00:11:53.814 --> 00:11:58.554
trial succeed, and the World Health Organization and the Congolese government approve them.

00:11:59.714 --> 00:12:04.654
Emanuele Capobanko, Gabby's director of Global Health Security, said he hoped those trials

00:12:04.654 --> 00:12:09.614
would finish in early 2027, and that the deal could bring deployment forward by months.

00:12:10.254 --> 00:12:17.454
On Thursday, Congolese data showed at least 12,021 confirmed infections, and 5,904 deaths

00:12:17.454 --> 00:12:18.254
since mid-May.

00:12:19.034 --> 00:12:24.454
Uganda declared its own outbreak over on July 28th, after 20 infections and two deaths.

00:12:24.454 --> 00:12:29.594
The trial asks whether the shot is safe and whether it prompts an immune response, including

00:12:29.594 --> 00:12:30.114
in children.

00:12:30.614 --> 00:12:33.734
It does not replace the response already underway in the Congo.

00:12:34.883 --> 00:12:39.143
Germany's count of Indian workers paying into social security has grown sevenfold in

00:12:39.143 --> 00:12:41.863
a decade, to more than 140,000.

00:12:42.303 --> 00:12:46.183
Many of them in information technology and healthcare, Deutscheweller reported.

00:12:46.923 --> 00:12:53.383
Prattie Saikia, 25, from Haryana, answered a 2022 ad from Magic Billion, a recruiter

00:12:53.383 --> 00:12:59.483
replacing Indian workers in checked jobs abroad. He came to Baton-Wootenburg with 180 other

00:12:59.483 --> 00:13:04.463
Indians for apprenticeships, finished three years at Metzgeri Letterer, a butcher shop,

00:13:04.903 --> 00:13:12.403
and now works their full time. A 2024 Bertelsman Foundation study concluded Germany needs 288,000

00:13:12.403 --> 00:13:16.443
foreign skilled workers a year until 2040 to replace retirees.

00:13:16.443 --> 00:13:24.263
FMC Group, a consultancy noted that more than 369,000 skilled jobs went unfilled in 2025.

00:13:24.943 --> 00:13:30.723
The country is also looking for electricians, mechatronics technicians, solar panel installers,

00:13:30.943 --> 00:13:34.203
and truck drivers, not only nurses and software specialists.

00:13:34.883 --> 00:13:40.683
Daniel Raja, who runs NM Nex Middlestand, a doosledor for Cruder, said hiring an electrician

00:13:40.683 --> 00:13:43.443
from India is still new for many middlestand firms.

00:13:43.443 --> 00:13:53.123
The small and medium-sized companies, so they hesitate and that workers' councils sometimes resist because they believe cheap Indian labor will take jobs or cut wages.

00:13:53.563 --> 00:14:06.863
David Kip, of the German Institute for International and Security Affairs, said he is skeptical of lowering language requirements, because people with little German have less contact with German institutions and are easier to exploit.

00:14:07.583 --> 00:14:12.963
Psychia had reached B-1, an intermediate level, and still found the theory class as hard

00:14:12.963 --> 00:14:15.583
until co-workers helped and his German improved.

00:14:16.511 --> 00:14:21.571
A blast on Saturday beside a middle school in Asadabad in Afghanistan's eastern Kuhnar

00:14:21.571 --> 00:14:24.711
province, killed students and injured scores more.

00:14:25.571 --> 00:14:30.111
Deutschewella, citing the interior ministry, reported at least seven students killed and

00:14:30.111 --> 00:14:31.391
nearly 100 injured.

00:14:32.091 --> 00:14:36.831
Early reports point to negligent storage of explosives at a mining company depot in the

00:14:36.831 --> 00:14:39.331
and deer-sir area next to the school.

00:14:40.011 --> 00:14:43.971
Provincial police spokesman Farid Dekhan said it was around 10 in the morning.

00:14:44.591 --> 00:14:50.731
Samuel Haq Haq Bayan, the provincial information director, told the German press agency DPA,

00:14:51.311 --> 00:14:55.691
the explosives were from mining and for clearing dangerous rocks along the Koonar Neuristan

00:14:55.691 --> 00:14:56.211
highway.

00:14:56.691 --> 00:14:58.571
No one has said what set them off.

00:14:59.111 --> 00:15:01.311
The ministry said an investigation is ongoing.

00:15:01.311 --> 00:15:06.991
Boeing. Al Jazeera quoted Maul Adad, head of Cunar Provincial Hospital, who counted

00:15:06.991 --> 00:15:12.211
at least six students killed and 97 injured, and said those numbers were preliminary and

00:15:12.211 --> 00:15:17.371
could change. Maul Aoi Samuel Hock told Al Jazeera the blast was in a house beside

00:15:17.371 --> 00:15:23.431
a middle school in Andar Serr, used by minors who had stored dynamite there. Interior Ministry

00:15:23.431 --> 00:15:29.691
spokesman Mufti Abdul-Mateen Kani said initial investigations point to negligence. Teams

00:15:29.691 --> 00:15:30.411
Times were at the scene.

00:15:30.991 --> 00:15:34.411
It was the third explosion near a school or religious school in a week.

00:15:34.971 --> 00:15:39.551
Two blasts near religious schools in Kapisa and Farah killed five students in total,

00:15:40.151 --> 00:15:43.531
and local officials blamed unexploded ordinance from earlier wars.

00:15:44.231 --> 00:15:47.291
The ministry figure is seven dead and nearly 100 injured.

00:15:47.771 --> 00:15:52.411
The hospital chief's figure is six dead and 97 injured, and he said it could move.

00:15:53.051 --> 00:15:58.211
Both accounts traced the blast to mining explosives stored beside the school, not to an attack.

00:15:58.211 --> 00:16:05.311
mining is a major industry in a country rich in iron, copper, lead, zinc, gold, coal, and gemstones,

00:16:05.491 --> 00:16:10.331
and safety at the sites is often poor. Gemstone mining is growing in Kunar.

00:16:11.256 --> 00:16:17.136
The United States said it disabled a ship in the Gulf of Oman while strictly enforcing a blockade of Iran's ports,

00:16:17.736 --> 00:16:22.016
and Kuwait summoned Iran's ambassador over a strike that killed two Italian technicians.

00:16:22.756 --> 00:16:26.956
S&amp;P changed its outlook on France's credit rating from stable to negative,

00:16:26.956 --> 00:16:32.616
a step that can proceed a downgrade as public debt and political uncertainty way on the finances.

00:16:33.356 --> 00:16:38.816
Regulators shut United Fidelity Bank, the largest United States bank failure in two years,

00:16:39.316 --> 00:16:44.496
and first citizens bought the assets. Francesca Albanese, the United Nations special

00:16:44.496 --> 00:16:50.676
rapporteur on the occupied Palestinian territory, left Juan Santa Maria Airport on Saturday after

00:16:50.676 --> 00:16:55.836
Costa Rica's constitutional court ordered her released, having been denied entry and held

00:16:55.836 --> 00:17:01.556
there a second night. India's foreign minister, S. Jai Shankar, told the Indian Ocean Rim

00:17:01.556 --> 00:17:07.336
Association that attacks on shipping threatened global trade and are unacceptable. Mexico's

00:17:07.336 --> 00:17:12.576
government called a United States Drug Enforcement Administration crime tip line foreign interference,

00:17:12.976 --> 00:17:18.016
while others welcomed it. India's Supreme Court ordered the Carthagai Deepum Lamp lit

00:17:18.016 --> 00:17:23.436
on Saturday at the disputed Deepathoon pillar. Criticized Tamil Nadu and Madurai officials

00:17:23.436 --> 00:17:28.476
for willful defiance of a November 20 order, suspended the Temple Trust's board,

00:17:28.996 --> 00:17:34.476
and allowed every devotee to take part. Doctors without borders set an Israeli strike on a Gaza

00:17:34.476 --> 00:17:39.056
clinic killed two staff, the Israeli military said it targeted Hamas fighters,

00:17:39.556 --> 00:17:45.036
and the World Health Organization condemned the strike. Poles closed in Taiwan's local elections,

00:17:45.456 --> 00:17:50.676
were campaigns stressed transport and childcare rather than China, while Beijing pressed the

00:17:50.676 --> 00:17:52.556
progressive candidate for Taipei mayor.

00:17:53.176 --> 00:17:57.836
National and regional leaders in France said hard-right activists fought left-wing counterparts

00:17:57.836 --> 00:18:01.116
in at least 10 towns during weeks of anti-government unrest.

00:18:01.716 --> 00:18:06.616
A government report said inflation in India may rise in coming months on weather and supply

00:18:06.616 --> 00:18:07.076
risks.

00:18:07.736 --> 00:18:13.176
President Lula's choice of a bridesco banker as Brazil's finance minister lifted markets.

00:18:13.776 --> 00:18:19.036
